{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"储能","country":"希腊","country_iso":"GRC","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:50:08.141303","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"GRC-ES-0003","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"希腊20个站点100MWh储能项目","project_name_en":"Greece 20 Sites 100MWh BESS Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"晶科能源","content":"晶科储能（Jinko ESS）近日宣布，与希腊重要客户成功签署100MWh储能项目。该项目将部署20套Jinko ESS G2 5MWh蓝鲸液冷储能系统（四小时长时储能配置），覆盖希腊境内20个不同项目站点，计划于2025年11月中旬分批交付。此次合作标志着晶科储能在欧洲分布式储能领域的进一步拓展，助力希腊构建灵活、稳定的清洁能源网络。\n晶科储能G2蓝鲸5MWh系统以94%的系统级充放电效率为核心优势，其四小时长时储能设计可深度参与电网调峰、削峰填谷及可再生能源平滑并网，显著提升电力系统经济性与可靠性。模块化集装箱结构适配希腊多山地、岛屿分散的地理特点，灵活部署于20个站点，有效缓解区域电网压力，加速当地风光资源消纳。项目采用液冷温控技术，将电芯温差精准控制在±2.5℃以内，结合多层级防火隔离舱体与热失控预警系统，从电芯、模组到系统实现三重防护，为高频运维提供高可靠性保障。\n系统搭载晶科储能自主研发的能源管理云平台，可实时监控20个站点的运行数据，并优化充放电策略。其按需定向冷却技术较传统方案减少20%辅助能耗，结合四小时系统的长时收益优势，预计每年可为运营商降低数万欧元综合成本。\n晶科储能欧洲总经理Roberto Murgioni表示：“希腊正加速推进‘2030年可再生能源占比70%’目标，此次20站联动的创新模式，不仅验证了G2蓝鲸系统的场景适应力，也为欧洲能源转型提供了高性价比的晶科方案。”","content_sha256":"200c38aa3ca98647253188bb559b7422aa4ea9cf9813f9cb88678a62c4c6720f","id":3312,"publish_date":"2025-06-08 13:11:31","title":"晶科储能在希腊签署100MWh储能项目","title_sha256":"793a4bd3c71efc343397523a753871cad75e347f4a3b14a34a0c209585e014e3","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/83740.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"GRC-ES-0003","capacity_details":"BESS: 100MWh","capacity_mw":100.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"100","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:50:08.141783","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"GRC-ES-0003-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.jinkosolar.com/site/newsdetail/2624\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"晶科储能科技有限公司","project_developer_en":"Jinko ESS","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"晶科储能（Jinko ESS）在希腊签署了100MWh的储能项目。该项目将部署20套5MWh的液冷储能系统，覆盖希腊境内20个不同站点，计划于2025年11月中旬交付。此项目旨在助力希腊构建灵活、稳定的清洁能源网络。","publish_date":"2025-06-08 13:11:31","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/83740.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":100.0,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"GRC-ES-0003","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
